      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Smart Energy will supply you with the products they sell and promises of whatever you want to hear. They're very efficient salesmen.They will organise fitting of said products but they may damage your property by doing so and then the wild goose chase begins of claiming the cost of the damage from them (which all correspondence will be ignored by them).They will also install these products which inevitably don't meet your requirements and fail to set them up for you or even explain to you how to set them up. You, of course, will not know this until at least a quarter has past and your power bill reflects the failure of set up.More empty promises ensue from the friendliest of salesmen that once the product is paid for, you are of no use to them.If you choose this supplier, Good Luck.",
