      "review_description": "Installation went well. No complaint.If you’re an avid solar energy enthusiast. Think carefully before deciding to go with this company.If you want to see your self consumption vs solar export. Beaware that this company will charge you an exorbitant amount to have a smart meter install.They failed to inform the customer about this add-on (which in my opinion should be included in the first place) Very poor selling practice.After sale care is somewhat OK. If you are expexting someone to pick up your call then they did just that. But expecting solutions to your issues, not soo much.",
